    "intro_html":  "Picadillo is the Cuban answer to weeknight ground beef, a sweet and briny simmer of beef, tomato, pepper, green olives, raisins, and capers that tastes like it took all day and does not. This wrap comes in at about \u003cstrong\u003e{{cal}} calories\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e, the leanest beef burrito in the batch, in a tortilla that carries 18 grams of fiber for 5 grams of net carb. If our Cuban Beef Picadillo Rice Bowls are on your rotation, this wrap goes fuller Havana, sweet raisins and briny capers folded right into the beef and rice for the classic sweet and salty picadillo you can eat with one hand.",
